    {
      "text_id": 2115,
      "text": "I did not sleep well so I feel tired . I do not feel like I am read to start the day because I feel sluggish . I feel overwhelmed because I have so much to do today . I wish I would have slept better so I would feel better overall and be ready to tackle the day instead of wanting to stay in bet for the rest of the day .",
      "timestamp": "2022-01-26T10:03:01",
      "order": 14,
      "valence": -1.0,
      "arousal": 0.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 2116,
      "text": "I am feeling pretty happy . After I got ready for the day I felt less sluggish and it\u2019s easier to get everything done that I needed to today . I feel a little tired from not sleeping well But I feel a lot better than I did this morning .",
      "timestamp": "2022-01-26T15:03:33",
      "order": 15,
      "valence": 1.0,
      "arousal": 1.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 2117,
      "text": "I went to the gym after work and made dinner at home so I feel relaxed and accomplished . I feel calmer than I felt in the morning when I woke up because I was stressed out in the morning about the things I have to accomplish all through the day .",
      "timestamp": "2022-01-26T20:09:54",
      "order": 16,
      "valence": 2.0,
      "arousal": 0.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 2118,
      "text": "I Slept pretty well last night so I feel rested and ready to start my day . I don\u2019t feel as anxious or overwhelmed as I did yesterday . I feel pretty happy and in a good mood and overall just feel good . I feel a lot better than yesterday .",
      "timestamp": "2022-01-27T10:57:16",
      "order": 17,
      "valence": 2.0,
      "arousal": 0.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 2119,
      "text": "I had a productive day and feel pretty happy . I feel like I accomplished a lot today . I feel like a had a great day at work and everything went smooth and everyone was nice and happy . I feel like today was a good day overall .",
      "timestamp": "2022-01-27T20:01:41",
      "order": 18,
      "valence": 1.0,
      "arousal": 1.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 2120,
      "text": "I feel somewhat tired because I went to bed super late . I feel a little sluggish but not too bad to start start my day . I kinda regret going to bed so late just because today will be a long day . Overall I just feel neutral not sad but not too happy either .",
      "timestamp": "2022-01-28T10:38:51",
      "order": 19,
      "valence": 0.0,
      "arousal": 1.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 2121,
      "text": "I feel sluggish and tired . I had a long day at work and regretted going out and staying up too late last night . I wish I had more energy to get things done today . I wish I would have slept a little more and better so I would not feel all day today .",
      "timestamp": "2022-01-28T15:02:08",
      "order": 20,
      "valence": -2.0,
      "arousal": 0.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 2122,
      "text": "I am feeling very neutral , not happy but not sad either . I feel like I have accomplished everything I needed today and can just relax for the night because I\u2019ll have a long weekend ahead of me . I just wish I did not feel as sluggish as I did early in the day .",
      "timestamp": "2022-01-28T20:44:01",
      "order": 21,
      "valence": 0.0,
      "arousal": 1.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 2123,
      "text": "I stayed up fairly late last night to finish my homework but I did sleep pretty good so I woke up rested and content . I feel calm and pretty happy and feel like I\u2019m ready to tackle the day . On the weekends I always have a ton of errands and things to do but I\u2019m not anxious or anything today because I slept well last night .",
      "timestamp": "2022-01-29T10:42:45",
      "order": 22,
      "valence": 1.0,
      "arousal": 0.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 2124,
      "text": "I had a long day at work so I just feel sluggish and tired . I feel like today was just crazy busy and I had to deal with a lot which made me feel sluggish and tired . My mood overall is kind of neutral because I am not sad but I\u2019m not very happy either .",
      "timestamp": "2022-01-29T16:53:18",
      "order": 23,
      "valence": -2.0,
      "arousal": 0.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 2125,
      "text": "I have been cleaning my house after work so I just feel very neutral and relaxed . I am not feeling anxious or anything just more of a neutral mood and when I feel like that I feel like cleaning is a good relaxation for me .",
      "timestamp": "2022-01-29T22:11:22",
      "order": 24,
      "valence": 0.0,
      "arousal": 1.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 2126,
      "text": "I slept well last night and feel well rested and pretty happy . I am excited for today because I don\u2019t have to work and get to watch football with friends . I got everything that I needed done early in the week so today I just get to relax and enjoy the day .",
      "timestamp": "2022-01-30T11:01:36",
      "order": 25,
      "valence": 2.0,
      "arousal": 1.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 2127,
      "text": "I\u2019m feeling pretty excited to be able to watch the football game so I am pretty happy . I am feeling nervous just because I want my team to win but overall I\u2019m just feeling happy that I got my week done and over with and can relax today .",
      "timestamp": "2022-01-30T15:01:14",
      "order": 26,
      "valence": 2.0,
      "arousal": 1.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 2128,
      "text": "Got to watch my home team win and I am extremely happy about that . I feel very calm and excited because of our hometown football team and their win . I don\u2019t feel anxious or anything just super happ and very excited .",
      "timestamp": "2022-01-30T20:21:24",
      "order": 27,
      "valence": 2.0,
      "arousal": 1.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 2129,
      "text": "I feel super sluggish because I might have eaten something that did not agree with my stomach so I did not sleep well at all and kept getting sick through the night . I feel like I did not drink too much so it had to be the food that I ate . I wish I did not have to work today because I know I\u2019ll feel sluggish all day .",
      "timestamp": "2022-01-31T10:02:20",
      "order": 28,
      "valence": -2.0,
      "arousal": 0.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 2130,
      "text": "I just do not feel good today so I feel very sluggish and tired . I feel like I am just slumping around because I do not feel good and did not sleep well either . I hope I get to go home and relax for awhile after I get off work and maybe I will start feel better .",
      "timestamp": "2022-01-31T15:03:32",
      "order": 29,
      "valence": -2.0,
      "arousal": 0.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 2131,
      "text": "I have not been feeling well today so I am just laying around the house and feel pretty neutral . I hope I feel better tomorrow after getting some sleep so I can get more done with my day than I did today .",
      "timestamp": "2022-01-31T20:05:07",
      "order": 30,
      "valence": 0.0,
      "arousal": 1.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 2132,
      "text": "Had a pretty long day but I just feel pretty neutral . I am not anxious or exhausted just tired from working a lot . I feel like I need to start making time to go to the gym so I would sleep better through the night .",
      "timestamp": "2022-02-02T21:31:44",
      "order": 31,
      "valence": 0.0,
      "arousal": 1.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 2133,
      "text": "I am feeling fine but kind of stuck . We are having a pretty bad snow storm so my work closed so I will just be stuck in the house all day because the roads are prettty bad . My mood is actually pretty good and I am pretty happy .",
      "timestamp": "2022-02-03T10:38:37",
      "order": 32,
      "valence": 0.0,
      "arousal": 0.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 2134,
      "text": "I feel pretty happy and just relaxed . There is a pretty big winter storm so I just get to sit at home all day because my work closed . I haven\u2019t had a nice relaxing day off in awhile so it\u2019s nice to just hang out",
      "timestamp": "2022-02-03T15:33:19",
      "order": 33,
      "valence": 1.0,
      "arousal": 1.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 2135,
      "text": "I just feel very neutral . Did not do a whole lot today because I was just stuck in the house so I just enjoyed the day off and caught up on some house and homework . It has been a very relaxing and quite day so I was just relaxing .",
      "timestamp": "2022-02-03T20:05:24",
      "order": 34,
      "valence": 0.0,
      "arousal": 0.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 2098,
      "text": "I think I might get another snow day because it is still snowing outside today . I haven\u2019t done a whole lot so I just feel calm and content . I feel like it will be a pretty calm weekend so I don\u2019t really have any plans or a whole lot to do .",
      "timestamp": "2022-02-04T10:01:18",
      "order": 35,
      "valence": 2.0,
      "arousal": 0.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 2099,
      "text": "I am stuck in the house for second day in a row so I am just content and calm at my house . I haven\u2019t done a whole lot yesterday or today and I am not used to being lazy for so many days in a row so it is kind of weird but it is nice",
      "timestamp": "2022-02-04T15:47:00",
      "order": 36,
      "valence": 2.0,
      "arousal": 0.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 2100,
      "text": "I am feeling calm and content . The winter storm has finally stopped but it\u2019s still very cold outside and I am just hanging out in the house . I feel pretty calm and relaxed because I haven\u2019t been doing anything for two days .",
      "timestamp": "2022-02-04T20:01:15",
      "order": 37,
      "valence": 2.0,
      "arousal": 0.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 2101,
      "text": "I have just been hanging out at home for a few days so I just feel calm and content . I have to go to work today but I feel pretty good about it just because I haven\u2019t seen anyone in a few days so it will be nice .",
      "timestamp": "2022-02-05T10:32:08",
      "order": 38,
      "valence": 2.0,
      "arousal": 0.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 2102,
      "text": "I am feeling pretty calm and content . I had a pretty easy shift at work and it was nice to see everyone even though it was a little slow . It was kind of weird to have to talk to so many people after I was at home by myself for awhile .",
      "timestamp": "2022-02-05T15:31:02",
      "order": 39,
      "valence": 1.0,
      "arousal": 0.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 2103,
      "text": "It\u2019s been a pretty good day so I am just pretty happy and relaxed . I got most of my house cleaned so that makes me feel more calm when I have my house clean . I\u2019m probably gonna meet some friends later so I\u2019m pretty happy about that .",
      "timestamp": "2022-02-05T20:00:48",
      "order": 40,
      "valence": 1.0,
      "arousal": 1.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 2104,
      "text": "I stayed out super late last night because I was hanging out with friends and having a good time . I woke up super early and could not fall back asleep so I am just tired . I don\u2019t really have a whole lot going on today so I am excited I can lounge around for a while .",
      "timestamp": "2022-02-06T10:01:05",
      "order": 41,
      "valence": -1.0,
      "arousal": 0.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 2105,
      "text": "I\u2019m feeling okay now . It\u2019s a pretty day so that makes me feel happy . I haven\u2019t done a whole lot today so I am just hanging out and doing some homework . It is nice not to have to rush to get things done since I got two days off early in the week .",
      "timestamp": "2022-02-06T15:22:44",
      "order": 42,
      "valence": 0.0,
      "arousal": 1.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 2106,
      "text": "I feel pretty calm and just sleepy . I had a pretty good day just hanging out and not really doing a whole lot so I am just ready for bed and get ready for tomorrow . Today was pretty uneventful just a quiet day .",
      "timestamp": "2022-02-06T20:31:38",
      "order": 43,
      "valence": 0.0,
      "arousal": 0.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 2107,
      "text": "I have a pretty exciting day today so I am pretty happy . I didn\u2019t sleep too great last night so I just feel a little sluggish . I have a lot to do today but I get to go to a pep rally with my friends tonight so I am pretty excited about that .",
      "timestamp": "2022-02-07T10:05:40",
      "order": 44,
      "valence": 2.0,
      "arousal": 0.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 2108,
      "text": "I got to leave work early and hang out with my friends so I am super happy . Our hometown team is going to super bowl so we went to the pep rally and even though it was freezing it was so awesome so I am feeling very happy .",
      "timestamp": "2022-02-07T22:01:59",
      "order": 45,
      "valence": 2.0,
      "arousal": 1.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 2109,
      "text": "I went out to celebrate with a few of my friends last night and had a super fun time I did not really drink a whole lot because we did not stay out long . I did have a beer and two cocktails . I got home early but did not sleep well at all just kept waking up through the night so I just feel super sluggish and sleepy today because I had to be up very early",
      "timestamp": "2022-02-08T10:20:58",
      "order": 46,
      "valence": -1.0,
      "arousal": 0.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 2110,
      "text": "I have been having a pretty rough day and I just feel super tired and very sluggish . I had a long day at school and it is pretty busy at work today as well so I just feel like I am dragging my feet all day .",
      "timestamp": "2022-02-08T15:10:30",
      "order": 47,
      "valence": -2.0,
      "arousal": 0.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 2111,
      "text": "I am just feeling very neutral and relaxed . I had a long day at work and school and I just want to sit down and hang out at the house . I just feel exhausted because I did not get good sleep last night and wish I could have slept better .",
      "timestamp": "2022-02-08T20:11:07",
      "order": 48,
      "valence": 0.0,
      "arousal": 1.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 2112,
      "text": "I feel pretty calm but pretty tired as well . I went to bed fairly early last night but I just kept waking up through the night so I did not get any quality sleep . I don\u2019t have a long day at work so I am not too worried about it .",
      "timestamp": "2022-02-09T10:19:20",
      "order": 49,
      "valence": 0.0,
      "arousal": 1.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
      "text_id": 2113,
      "text": "I\u2019m feeling pretty content today but just kind of sluggish . I had a fairly easy day at work so I am not stressed out but just feel super tired today . I was hoping I would feel better in the afternoon so I could go to the gym but I just don\u2019t feel like it .",
      "timestamp": "2022-02-09T15:24:07",
      "order": 50,
      "valence": 1.0,
      "arousal": 0.0,
      "collection_phase": 2,
      "is_words": false
    },
    {
